OL,3,AAngry Anderson, rock star who
OL,4,Asoundtracked Kylie's wedding in
OL,5,ANeighbours, dies aged 79
OL,6,
OL,7,FRock star Angry Anderson, whose music
OL,8,Ffamously soundtracked the wedding of
OL,9,FKylie Minogue and Jason Donovan's
OL,10,Fcharacters in Australian TV soap
OL,11,FNeighbours, has died at the age of 79.
OL,13,FThe musician, whose real name was Gary
OL,14,FAnderson, rose to fame as the frontman
OL,15,Fof Rose Tattoo, one of Australia's most
OL,16,Frevered rock bands, from 1976.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
