OL,3,AAngry Anderson, rock star who
OL,4,Asoundtracked Kylie's wedding in
OL,5,ANeighbours, dies aged 79
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis solo song Suddenly became a global
OL,8,Fhit after it was played during the
OL,9,Fwedding of Minogue and Donovan's
OL,10,Fcharacters Scott and Charlene in
OL,11,FNeighbours. The wedding episode was
OL,12,Fwatched by 20 million people in the UK
OL,13,Falone in 1988.
OL,15,FAnderson said Minogue had been
OL,16,F"adamant" that the track was used for
OL,17,Fthe scene, and he later declared that
OL,18,FSuddenly was the best song he had ever
OL,19,Fwritten.
